Will Bo-bobo and friends
find the medicine

00:23:53.165 --> 00:23:55.301
before it's too late?

00:23:57.369 --> 00:23:59.972
Oh, and...
what'll happen to Don Patch?

00:24:00.272 --> 00:24:01.640
Whatever.

00:24:01.807 --> 00:24:03.542
Zygas! Zygas!

00:24:04.843 --> 00:24:12.451
Happy, happy, I'm always happy...

00:24:18.724 --> 00:24:25.564
Where does happiness come from?

00:24:25.564 --> 00:24:30.836
I will go to you again today.

00:24:32.504 --> 00:24:39.411
Happiness comes
suddenly when I'm sleeping.

00:24:40.346 --> 00:24:43.248
If you're happy,

00:24:43.248 --> 00:24:47.987
show everyone by raising
your arms into the air!

00:24:49.588 --> 00:24:56.996
Happy, happy, I'm always happy.

00:24:57.363 --> 00:25:03.335
I wish that it would never end.

00:25:03.335 --> 00:25:12.077
Happy, happy, we are happy!

00:25:12.077 --> 00:25:16.648
Because I am loved...

00:25:18.417 --> 00:25:21.520
...forever!

00:25:24.323 --> 00:25:26.725
Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo

00:25:27.259 --> 00:25:30.329
| am proud to announce this
year's Miss Chicken Queen...

00:25:30.329 --> 00:25:32.631
We're in the enemy base!
Stop goofing off!

00:25:32.631 --> 00:25:37.069
But this is really fun! I can turn
into a cyborg and a monster cat!

00:25:37.069 --> 00:25:39.905
Stop having fun by yourselves
and look at reality!

00:25:39.905 --> 00:25:42.908
You're right. Look at that guy
with the really suspicious pink face!

00:25:42.908 --> 00:25:44.710
Wow, it's really suspicious!

00:25:44.843 --> 00:25:46.545
Next time on Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo:

00:25:46.645 --> 00:25:46.879
10th Miss Chicken Queen Chickie
and The Mysterious Guard Softon!

00:25:46.879 --> 00:25:50.616
70th Miss Chicken Queen Chickie and The Mysterious Guard Softon
10th Miss Chicken Queen Chickie and The Mysterious Guard Softon!

00:25:50.682 --> 00:25:52.551
He's too mysterious!
